      "id": "hook",
      "text": "Chinese history ,from PanGu  kai tian pi di",
      "pause_after": 0.6,
      "text_zh": "一八一五年，地球另一端的一座火山，让整个欧洲失去了夏天。这就是“没有夏天的一年”的故事。",
      "clips": [
        {
          "image": "assets/commons/pangu-3128968.jpg",
          "motion": "zoom_in",
          "credit": "Wang Qi — Public domain — https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pangu.jpg"
        },
        {
          "image": "assets/commons/20250122-158568137.jpg",
          "motion": "zoom_in",
          "credit": "阿道 — CC BY-SA 4.0 — https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%B8%89%E9%87%8D%E5%85%88%E5%97%87%E5%AE%AE%E7%9B%A4%E5%8F%A4%E5%A4%A7%E5%B8%9D_20250122.jpg"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "eruption",
      "text": "Mount Tambora, on the island of Sumbawa, erupted with a force ten times greater than Krakatoa. It threw so much ash into the stratosphere that sunlight itself dimmed.",
      "pause_after": 0.6,
      "text_zh": "松巴哇岛上的坦博拉火山爆发，威力是喀拉喀托火山的十倍。它把大量火山灰抛入平流层，连阳光都黯淡了。",
      "clips": [
        {
          "image": "assets/02_eruption.jpg",
          "motion": "pan_right"
        },
        {
          "image": "assets/commons/eth-bib-rar-5880-karte-der-insel-sumbawa-154249356.jpg",
          "motion": "zoom_in",
          "credit": "Rudolf Leuzinger / Jakob Melchior Ziegler — Public domain — https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:ETH-Bib_RAR_5880_Karte_der_Insel_Sumbawa_und_Tambora_1855.jpg"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timeline",
      "label": "From eruption to famine",
      "text": "April 1815, the eruption. June 1816, snow in New England. July, the harvest fails across France. By 1817, bread riots.",
      "text_zh": "一八一五年四月，火山喷发。一八一六年六月，新英格兰下雪。七月，法国粮食绝收。到一八一七年，面包暴动。",
      "label_zh": "从喷发到饥荒",
      "clips": [
